---
/**
 * Perfil de especialista. Los perfiles marcados como draft se construyen para
 * revision interna pero salen con noindex y fuera del sitemap: publicar un
 * perfil medico con datos placeholder danaria la autoridad del dominio.
 */
import type { GetStaticPaths } from 'astro';
import { render } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import AppointmentCTA from '../../components/AppointmentCTA.astro';
import WhatsAppButton from '../../components/WhatsAppButton.astro';
import ServiceCard from '../../components/ServiceCard.astro';
import FAQ from '../../components/FAQ.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
import MedicalDisclaimer from '../../components/MedicalDisclaimer.astro';
import RelatedLinks from '../../components/RelatedLinks.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';

import { getMedicosAll, getServiciosPorIds, getUbicacionesPorIds } from '../../lib/content';
import { routes, absolute } from '../../lib/urls';
import { physicianSchema, faqSchema } from '../../lib/schema';
import { isTBC } from '../../config/site';

export const getStaticPaths = (async () => {
  const medicos = await getMedicosAll();
  return medicos.map((medico) => ({ params: { medico: medico.id }, props: { medico } }));
}) satisfies GetStaticPaths;

const { medico } = Astro.props;
const d = medico.data;
const { Content } = await render(medico);

const [servicios, ubicaciones] = await Promise.all([
  getServiciosPorIds(d.services.map((s) => s.id)),
  getUbicacionesPorIds(d.locations.map((l) => l.id)),
]);

const fullName = [d.honorific, d.name].filter(Boolean).join(' ');
const crumbs = [
  { label: 'Inicio', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Médicos', href: routes.medicos },
  { label: d.name, href: routes.medico(medico.id) },
];

const url = absolute(routes.medico(medico.id));
const schemas = [
  physicianSchema({
    slug: medico.id,
    name: d.name,
    honorific: d.honorific,
    specialty: d.specialty,
    description: d.bio,
    photo: d.photo,
    url,
    locations: ubicaciones.map((u) => ({ name: u.data.name, slug: u.id })),
    languages: d.languages,
    doctoraliaUrl: d.doctoraliaUrl,
  }),
  faqSchema(d.faq),
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title={d.seo.title}
  description={d.seo.description}
  canonical={routes.medico(medico.id)}
  crumbs={crumbs}
  schemas={schemas}
  noindex={d.draft || d.seo.noindex}
  doctor={medico.id}
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow={d.specialty} title={fullName} crumbs={crumbs}>
    <Fragment slot="actions">
      <AppointmentCTA label="Agendar consulta" doctor={medico.id} />
      <WhatsAppButton variant="secondary" doctor={medico.id} />
    </Fragment>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      {d.draft && (
        <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
          <Icon name="info" size={18} />
          <p>
            <strong>Perfil en preparación (no indexado).</strong> Esta página es la
            plantilla lista para recibir la información verificable del especialista.
            Todos los campos marcados con [POR CONFIRMAR] deben completarse antes de
            publicar; ver <code>CONTENT_NEEDED.md</code>.
          </p>
        </div>
      )}

      <div class="location-panel__grid">
        <div class="measure">
          <h2>Semblanza</h2>
          <p class={`lead ${isTBC(d.bio) ? 'text-muted' : ''}`} style="margin-top:1rem">{d.bio}</p>

          <div class="prose" style="margin-top:1.5rem"><Content /></div>

          {d.education.length > 0 && (
            <div style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)">
              <h2>Formación</h2>
              <ul class="data-list" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
                {d.education.map((e) => (
                  <li class="data-list__row">
                    <Icon name="check" size={18} />
                    <span class={isTBC(e) ? 'text-muted' : ''}>{e}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          )}

          {d.certifications.length > 0 && (
            <div style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)">
              <h2>Certificaciones</h2>
              <ul class="data-list" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
                {d.certifications.map((c) => (
                  <li class="data-list__row">
                    <Icon name="shield" size={18} />
                    <span class={isTBC(c) ? 'text-muted' : ''}>{c}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          )}

          {d.publications.length > 0 && (
            <div style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)">
              <h2>Publicaciones</h2>
              <ul class="data-list" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
                {d.publications.map((p) => (
                  <li class="data-list__row">
                    <Icon name="chevron" size={16} />
                    <span>{p.url ? <a href={p.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{p.title}</a> : p.title}{p.source && ` — ${p.source}`}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          )}

          <MedicalDisclaimer class="mt-2xl" />
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="guide-widget">
            <h2 style="font-size:var(--step-1)">Información profesional</h2>
            <ul class="data-list" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
              <li class="data-list__row">
                <Icon name="stethoscope" size={18} />
                <span>
                  <span class="data-list__label">Especialidad</span>
                  <span class={isTBC(d.specialty) ? 'text-muted' : ''}>{d.specialty}</span>
                </span>
              </li>
              {d.licenses.map((l) => (
                <li class="data-list__row">
                  <Icon name="shield" size={18} />
                  <span>
                    <span class="data-list__label">{l.label}</span>
                    <span class={isTBC(l.value) ? 'text-muted' : ''}>{l.value}</span>
                  </span>
                </li>
              ))}
              {d.experience && (
                <li class="data-list__row">
                  <Icon name="clock" size={18} />
                  <span>
                    <span class="data-list__label">Experiencia</span>
                    <span class={isTBC(d.experience) ? 'text-muted' : ''}>{d.experience}</span>
                  </span>
                </li>
              )}
              <li class="data-list__row">
                <Icon name="users" size={18} />
                <span>
                  <span class="data-list__label">Idiomas</span>
                  <span>{d.languages.join(', ')}</span>
                </span>
              </li>
              {ubicaciones.length > 0 && (
                <li class="data-list__row">
                  <Icon name="map-pin" size={18} />
                  <span>
                    <span class="data-list__label">Sedes</span>
                    {ubicaciones.map((u) => (
                      <a style="display:block" href={routes.ubicacion(u.id)}>{u.data.city}</a>
                    ))}
                  </span>
                </li>
              )}
            </ul>
            <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
              <AppointmentCTA block label="Agendar consulta" doctor={medico.id} />
              <WhatsAppButton block variant="secondary" doctor={medico.id} />
            </div>
            {d.doctoraliaUrl && (
              <p style="margin-top:1rem;font-size:.85rem">
                <a class="link-arrow" href={d.doctoraliaUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ver perfil en Doctoralia</a>
              </p>
            )}
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {servicios.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section section--alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Servicios que atiende</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          {servicios.map((s) => (
            <ServiceCard slug={s.id} name={s.data.name} excerpt={s.data.excerpt} icon={s.data.icon} />
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  {d.faq.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <FAQ items={d.faq} title="Preguntas frecuentes" />
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <RelatedLinks
        title="Explora también"
        items={[
          { label: 'Todo el equipo médico', href: routes.medicos },
          ...ubicaciones.map((u) => ({ label: `Sede ${u.data.city}`, href: routes.ubicacion(u.id) })),
        ]}
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection doctor={medico.id} title={`Agenda con ${fullName}`} showLocations={false} />
</BaseLayout>
